<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian birr unchanged against dollar.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian birr unchanged against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Ethiopia (NBE) said on Monday that the birr remained unchanged against the dollar for the fourth week.</p>
<p>It quoted the birr at a mean rate of 6.6040 against the dollar, unchanged. The bank said that following the currency auction on May 3, the applicable rate for all transactions outside the auction in the May 5 to 11 period would remain 6.6040 birr to the dollar.</p>
<p>--Tsegaye Tadesse ++2511-511-058.</p>
